=SRM FOLLOW-UP REQUEST

A new SRM prospect has requested to be contacted by a Heart2Heart Enterprise Representative.

LEAD DETAILS

Name: {{$json["Full Name"]}}
WhatsApp / Phone: {{$json["WhatsApp / Phone"]}}
Email: {{$json["Email Address"]}}
Location: {{$json["Location"]}}

WHAT THEY SHARED

{{$json["Situation Response"]}}

FOLLOW-UP ACTION

Please contact this person and:

1. Introduce yourself as a Heart2Heart Enterprise Representative.
2. Confirm that they requested information about the Self-Realization Mentorship Programme (SRM).
3. Answer their questions and provide any information they need about the programme.
4. If they are ready to proceed, guide them through the official registration and payment process.
5. Record any important outcome or update for the H2H team.

Lead ID: {{$json["Lead ID"]}}

Thank you.

